WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.380
If you're on a split-dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.320
Confirm with your written instructions.

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:10.320
Split dosing means you take the first half of your prep the evening before and

4
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.680
the second half the morning of your procedure,

5
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.640
typically six hours before your arrival time.

6
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.390
When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second dose as directed on your

7
00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:21.500
prep instructions.

8
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.330
Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until the cutoff time we've

9
00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.240
specified.

10
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.360
Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear.

11
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.360
That's how we know your prep is working.

12
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.380
If you have any concerns about how things are going, call our office first

13
00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.400
thing in the morning.

14
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.400
You're almost done.
